flowchart TD
 Shell[One account/search/workspace/Action Center] --> Discovery[Scoped workspace discovery]
 Discovery --> Console[Existing console extended]
 Console --> Inbox[Work and approvals]
 Inbox --> Gate[Existing governance / proposed 14-check contract]
 Gate --> Commands[Exact digest / idempotent domain commands]
 Commands --> Data[Canonical state / audit / outbox]
 Data --> Worker[Publisher / retry / DLQ]
 Worker --> Rail[Regulated rail / approved adapter]
 Rail --> Reconcile[Authoritative receipt / reconciliation]
 Reconcile --> Data
 Data --> Projection[Scoped source/freshness read models]
 Projection --> Console
 Projection --> Portal[Immutable audience packages]
 Projection --> Agents[12 proposed observe agents]
 Agents --> Draft[Bounded drafts / handoffs]
 Draft --> Inbox
